OL,3,GNEWSAFive charged over football pitch
OL,4,Ahearse disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive men have been charged over the
OL,7,Forganisation of violent disorder after
OL,8,Fa funeral hearse was driven onto a
OL,9,Ffootball pitch.
OL,11,FNorthumbria Police have been
OL,12,Finvestigating a number of incidents
OL,13,Ffrom summer 2023, which are believed to
OL,14,Fbe connected, including a hearse being
OL,15,Fdriven onto the pitch at a Dunston UTC
OL,16,Fv Gateshead match at Dunston Football
OL,17,FClub.
OL,19,FThere were also reports of criminal
OL,20,Fdamage across addresses in the Dunston
OL,21,Fand Byker areas, as well as a report of
OL,22,Fa stolen vehicle from the Durham area.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
